{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":9580,\"date\":\"2025-09-13T01:51:08+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-09-12T23:51:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-26-in-arrivo-lunedi-ecco-le-novita\",\"title\":\"watchOS 26 in Arrivo Lunedì: Ecco le Novità\",\"excerpt\":\"watchOS 26 sarà rilasciato lunedì 15 settembre, con novità come Sleep Score e Hypertension Notifications, accessibili anche su modelli precedenti.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/09/watchos-26-gradient-light-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos gradient light\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":164,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":9193,\"date\":\"2025-09-04T14:22:32+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-09-04T12:22:32+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-pro-3-arrivo-nuove-funzionalita\",\"title\":\"AirPods Pro 3 in Arrivo la Prossima Settimana con Nuove Funzionalità\",\"excerpt\":\"Manca meno di una settimana all'evento \\\"Awe Dropping\\\" di Apple, dove si prevede il lancio degli aggiornati AirPods Pro 3, con nuove funzionalità e un design rivisitato.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/09/AirPods-Pro-3-Mock-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"AirPods Pro Mock Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":348,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":9136,\"date\":\"2025-06-21T15:25:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-06-21T13:25:25+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-presenta-macos-26-tahoe-tutte-le-novita\",\"title\":\"Apple pres